// Title: Exchange PowerShell Snap-Ins Usage
// ID: 25676e10-2121-446e-80a4-71ff8506af47
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: FPT.EagleEye, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2021-03-03
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001, attack.collection, attack.t1114
// Description: Detects adding and using Exchange PowerShell snap-ins to export mailbox data. As seen used by HAFNIUM and APT27
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Add-PSSnapin")) AND (((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\powershell.exe") OR where(Image IENDSWITH "\\pwsh.exe"))) OR ((where(OriginalFileName = "PowerShell.EXE") OR where(OriginalFileName = "pwsh.dll")))) AND ((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Microsoft.Exchange.Powershell.Snapin") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Microsoft.Exchange.Management.PowerShell.SnapIn")))) AND NOT ((where(ParentImage = "C:\\Windows\\System32\\msiexec.exe") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "$exserver=Get-ExchangeServer ([Environment]::MachineName) -ErrorVariable exerr 2> $null"))))
